{"name":"M1.9 BillOfMaterial - PDM","pkg":"M1.9","notes":"M1.9 BillOfMaterial - Physical Data Model (domain view)\nBill of material: BOM headers per usage and version, effectivity, component lines, alternatives, variant rules and reference designators.\nDatabricks | Delta Lake | 6 tables, 82 columns","hideLabels":false,"items":[{"kind":"note","name":"","text":"M1.9 BillOfMaterial - Physical Data Model (domain view)\nBill of material: BOM headers per usage and version, effectivity, component lines, alternatives, variant rules and reference designators.\nDatabricks | Delta Lake | 6 tables, 82 columns","x":40,"y":30,"w":2176,"h":78,"style":{"fill":"#0B2026","border":"#FF3621","font":"#FFFFFF","bw":3}},{"kind":"note","name":"","text":"LEGEND\nBig box = domain M1.x (own package); inner box = group of related tables. Every domain has its own colour; a stronger fill and a thick border mark a table added by the extension (not in the uploaded schema).\nTable = Delta table in Databricks / Unity Catalog (identity key id, informational primary and foreign keys). Stereotype <<table>>, columns <<column>>.\nNavy line <<FK>> = foreign key inside a domain. Orange line = foreign key across domains. Grey line = reference to an external table.\nConnector label = semantic verb phrase read from the child table (holding the foreign key) to the parent table; the arrow points to the parent.\nCompact view: each table shows only its first columns. The domain diagrams and the class properties show all columns.","x":40,"y":138,"w":1500,"h":114,"style":{"fill":"#F9F7F4","border":"#1B3139","font":"#1B3139","bw":1}},{"kind":"note","name":"","text":"TYPICAL MES TERMS FOR THE CONCEPTS OF THIS DOMAIN (verify against the product version)\nBill of material:\n   ISA-95 / IEC 62264: Material Definition (assembly), Material Specification\n   ISA-88 / IEC 61512: Formula (ingredient list)\n   SAP (ERP, ME, DM): BOM (STKO, STPO)\n   Siemens Opcenter: Bill of Material\n   DELMIA Apriso: Bill of Material\n   AVEVA MES: Bill of Materials\n   Rockwell (Plex, PharmaSuite): BOM\n   Critical Manufacturing: Bill of Materials\n   Werum PAS-X: Formula, Bill of Materials\n   MPDV HYDRA: St\u00fcckliste","x":40,"y":282,"w":2176,"h":204,"style":{"fill":"#F9F7F4","border":"#1B3139","font":"#1B3139","bw":1}},{"kind":"boundary","name":"M1.9 BillOfMaterial","x":40,"y":536,"w":1759,"h":1088,"style":{"fill":"#F9F8F5","border":"#7A6A2B","font":"#1B3139","bw":3},"notes":"Domain M1.9 BillOfMaterial - Physical Data Model (Delta Lake, Databricks / Unity Catalog).\nBill of material: BOM headers per usage and version, effectivity, component lines, alternatives, variant rules and reference designators.\nTables: 6 (1 added by the extension), columns: 82.\n  - Bill of material: product.bom, product.bom_effectivity, product.bom_item, product.bom_item_alternative, product.bom_item_variant_rule, product.bom_item_ref_des\nDepends on (foreign keys to other domains):\n  - M1.1 ProductionStructure: 1 keys, e.g. product.bom.site_id is located at core.site\n  - M1.2 MaterialStructure: 6 keys, e.g. product.bom.material_id is bill of material for product.material; product.bom.base_uom_id is measured in core.unit_of_measure; product.bom_item.component_material_id uses component product.material\n  - M1.5 ProcessDefinition: 2 keys, e.g. product.bom.change_request_id is governed by change core.change_request; product.bom_effectivity.change_request_id is governed by change core.change_request\n  - M1.8 BillOfProcess: 1 keys, e.g. product.bom_item.process_step_id applies to step process.step\nUsed by (foreign keys from other domains):\n  - M1.8 BillOfProcess: 2 keys\nTYPICAL MES TERMS FOR THE CONCEPTS OF THIS DOMAIN (verify against the product version)\nBill of material:\n   ISA-95 / IEC 62264: Material Definition (assembly), Material Specification\n   ISA-88 / IEC 61512: Formula (ingredient list)\n   SAP (ERP, ME, DM): BOM (STKO, STPO)\n   Siemens Opcenter: Bill of Material\n   DELMIA Apriso: Bill of Material\n   AVEVA MES: Bill of Materials\n   Rockwell (Plex, PharmaSuite): BOM\n   Critical Manufacturing: Bill of Materials\n   Werum PAS-X: Formula, Bill of Materials\n   MPDV HYDRA: St\u00fcckliste\nVendor terms are typical names from public product documentation as I know it; object names differ by product and version, so verify them before you build a mapping.","level":"domain"},{"kind":"boundary","name":"Bill of material","x":74,"y":626,"w":1691,"h":964,"style":{"fill":"#FDFDFC","border":"#7A6A2B","font":"#1B3139","bw":1},"notes":"Group 'Bill of material' of domain M1.9 BillOfMaterial","level":"group"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.bom","x":100,"y":694,"w":353,"h":482,"style":{"fill":"#F3F2EC","border":"#7A6A2B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.bom_effectivity","x":503,"y":694,"w":353,"h":274,"style":{"fill":"#E4E1D5","border":"#7A6A2B","font":"#1B3139","bw":3},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.bom_item","x":906,"y":694,"w":379,"h":546,"style":{"fill":"#F3F2EC","border":"#7A6A2B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.bom_item_alternative","x":1335,"y":694,"w":404,"h":322,"style":{"fill":"#F3F2EC","border":"#7A6A2B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.bom_item_variant_rule","x":100,"y":1290,"w":340,"h":242,"style":{"fill":"#F3F2EC","border":"#7A6A2B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.bom_item_ref_des","x":490,"y":1290,"w":366,"h":274,"style":{"fill":"#F3F2EC","border":"#7A6A2B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"boundary","name":"Referenced from other domains (compact view)","x":40,"y":1764,"w":2136,"h":570,"style":{"fill":"#F5F6F7","border":"#6B7C85","font":"#1B3139","bw":1},"notes":"Tables of other domains that this domain references or that reference it (compact view).","level":"neighbor"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.material","x":74,"y":1854,"w":385,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#EBF2F8","border":"#2272B4","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"core.site","x":509,"y":1854,"w":366,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#FFEDEB","border":"#FF3621","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"core.unit_of_measure","x":925,"y":1854,"w":347,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#EBF2F8","border":"#2272B4","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"core.change_request","x":1322,"y":1854,"w":372,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#E8F7F2","border":"#00A972","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"process.step","x":1744,"y":1854,"w":398,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#F8ECF5","border":"#B4308B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.option_value","x":74,"y":2102,"w":328,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#EBF2F8","border":"#2272B4","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"process.production_version","x":452,"y":2102,"w":372,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#F0D6E8","border":"#B4308B","font":"#1B3139","bw":3},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"process.step_material_req","x":874,"y":2102,"w":366,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#F8ECF5","border":"#B4308B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"}]},
{"name":"M1.10 TraceabilityProfile - PDM","pkg":"M1.10","notes":"M1.10 TraceabilityProfile - Physical Data Model (domain view)\nTraceability profile: identifier types and profiles, serial and lot numbering, number ranges, tracking depth, genealogy rules, step-level trace capture and labels.\nDatabricks | Delta Lake | 10 tables, 145 columns","hideLabels":false,"items":[{"kind":"note","name":"","text":"M1.10 TraceabilityProfile - Physical Data Model (domain view)\nTraceability profile: identifier types and profiles, serial and lot numbering, number ranges, tracking depth, genealogy rules, step-level trace capture and labels.\nDatabricks | Delta Lake | 10 tables, 145 columns","x":40,"y":30,"w":2209,"h":78,"style":{"fill":"#0B2026","border":"#FF3621","font":"#FFFFFF","bw":3}},{"kind":"note","name":"","text":"LEGEND\nBig box = domain M1.x (own package); inner box = group of related tables. Every domain has its own colour; a stronger fill and a thick border mark a table added by the extension (not in the uploaded schema).\nTable = Delta table in Databricks / Unity Catalog (identity key id, informational primary and foreign keys). Stereotype <<table>>, columns <<column>>.\nNavy line <<FK>> = foreign key inside a domain. Orange line = foreign key across domains. Grey line = reference to an external table.\nConnector label = semantic verb phrase read from the child table (holding the foreign key) to the parent table; the arrow points to the parent.\nCompact view: each table shows only its first columns. The domain diagrams and the class properties show all columns.","x":40,"y":138,"w":1500,"h":114,"style":{"fill":"#F9F7F4","border":"#1B3139","font":"#1B3139","bw":1}},{"kind":"note","name":"","text":"TYPICAL MES TERMS FOR THE CONCEPTS OF THIS DOMAIN (verify against the product version)\nSerial number, identifier and genealogy:\n   ISA-95 / IEC 62264: Material Lot, Material Sublot, Physical Asset identification\n   ISA-88 / IEC 61512: Batch / lot identification\n   SAP (ERP, ME, DM): Serial number profile, SFC number (ME/DM)\n   Siemens Opcenter: Container, Serial number\n   DELMIA Apriso: Serial number, Lot\n   AVEVA MES: Serial, Lot\n   Rockwell (Plex, PharmaSuite): Serial, Container\n   Critical Manufacturing: Material, Container\n   Werum PAS-X: Batch number\n   MPDV HYDRA: Seriennummer, Chargennummer\nLabels and marking:\n   SAP (ERP, ME, DM): Label (ME/DM label print)\n   Siemens Opcenter: Label\n   DELMIA Apriso: Label\n   AVEVA MES: Label\n   Rockwell (Plex, PharmaSuite): Label\n   Critical Manufacturing: Label\n   Werum PAS-X: Label\n   MPDV HYDRA: Etikett","x":40,"y":282,"w":2209,"h":339,"style":{"fill":"#F9F7F4","border":"#1B3139","font":"#1B3139","bw":1}},{"kind":"boundary","name":"M1.10 TraceabilityProfile","x":40,"y":671,"w":1760,"h":2140,"style":{"fill":"#F6F8F9","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":3},"notes":"Domain M1.10 TraceabilityProfile - Physical Data Model (Delta Lake, Databricks / Unity Catalog).\nTraceability profile: identifier types and profiles, serial and lot numbering, number ranges, tracking depth, genealogy rules, step-level trace capture and labels.\nTables: 10 (4 added by the extension), columns: 145.\n  - Serial & identifier rules: product.identifier_type, product.identifier_profile, product.serial_profile, product.serial_number_range, core.number_sequence\n  - Tracking & genealogy: product.tracking_policy, product.genealogy_rule, process.step_trace_rule\n  - Labels: product.label_spec, core.label_template\nDepends on (foreign keys to other domains):\n  - M1.1 ProductionStructure: 2 keys, e.g. product.serial_number_range.site_id is located at core.site; core.number_sequence.site_id is located at core.site\n  - M1.2 MaterialStructure: 13 keys, e.g. product.identifier_profile.material_id is defined for product.material; product.identifier_profile.product_family_id belongs to product family product.product_family; product.identifier_profile.customer_id is specific to customer core.business_partner\n  - M1.4 BatchProfile: 1 keys, e.g. product.identifier_profile.lot_number_rule_id belongs to product.lot_number_rule\n  - M1.6 ParameterDefinition: 1 keys, e.g. process.step_trace_rule.parameter_def_id captures parameter process.parameter_def\n  - M1.8 BillOfProcess: 1 keys, e.g. process.step_trace_rule.step_id captures at step process.step\nUsed by (foreign keys from other domains):\n  - M1.2 MaterialStructure: 2 keys\n  - M1.8 BillOfProcess: 1 keys\nTYPICAL MES TERMS FOR THE CONCEPTS OF THIS DOMAIN (verify against the product version)\nSerial number, identifier and genealogy:\n   ISA-95 / IEC 62264: Material Lot, Material Sublot, Physical Asset identification\n   ISA-88 / IEC 61512: Batch / lot identification\n   SAP (ERP, ME, DM): Serial number profile, SFC number (ME/DM)\n   Siemens Opcenter: Container, Serial number\n   DELMIA Apriso: Serial number, Lot\n   AVEVA MES: Serial, Lot\n   Rockwell (Plex, PharmaSuite): Serial, Container\n   Critical Manufacturing: Material, Container\n   Werum PAS-X: Batch number\n   MPDV HYDRA: Seriennummer, Chargennummer\nLabels and marking:\n   SAP (ERP, ME, DM): Label (ME/DM label print)\n   Siemens Opcenter: Label\n   DELMIA Apriso: Label\n   AVEVA MES: Label\n   Rockwell (Plex, PharmaSuite): Label\n   Critical Manufacturing: Label\n   Werum PAS-X: Label\n   MPDV HYDRA: Etikett\nVendor terms are typical names from public product documentation as I know it; object names differ by product and version, so verify them before you build a mapping.","level":"domain"},{"kind":"boundary","name":"Serial & identifier rules","x":74,"y":761,"w":1692,"h":980,"style":{"fill":"#FCFDFD","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":1},"notes":"Group 'Serial & identifier rules' of domain M1.10 TraceabilityProfile","level":"group"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.identifier_type","x":100,"y":829,"w":411,"h":370,"style":{"fill":"#D8DEE6","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":3},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.identifier_profile","x":561,"y":829,"w":360,"h":450,"style":{"fill":"#D8DEE6","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":3},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.serial_profile","x":971,"y":829,"w":366,"h":354,"style":{"fill":"#EEF0F4","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.serial_number_range","x":1387,"y":829,"w":353,"h":322,"style":{"fill":"#EEF0F4","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"core.number_sequence","x":100,"y":1329,"w":347,"h":386,"style":{"fill":"#EEF0F4","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"boundary","name":"Tracking & genealogy","x":74,"y":1787,"w":1282,"h":496,"style":{"fill":"#FCFDFD","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":1},"notes":"Group 'Tracking & genealogy' of domain M1.10 TraceabilityProfile","level":"group"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.tracking_policy","x":100,"y":1855,"w":404,"h":402,"style":{"fill":"#EEF0F4","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.genealogy_rule","x":554,"y":1855,"w":360,"h":386,"style":{"fill":"#D8DEE6","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":3},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"process.step_trace_rule","x":964,"y":1855,"w":366,"h":354,"style":{"fill":"#D8DEE6","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":3},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"boundary","name":"Labels","x":74,"y":2329,"w":802,"h":448,"style":{"fill":"#FCFDFD","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":1},"notes":"Group 'Labels' of domain M1.10 TraceabilityProfile","level":"group"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.label_spec","x":100,"y":2397,"w":353,"h":306,"style":{"fill":"#EEF0F4","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"table","name":"core.label_template","x":503,"y":2397,"w":347,"h":354,"style":{"fill":"#EEF0F4","border":"#3D5A80","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"full"},{"kind":"boundary","name":"Referenced from other domains (compact view)","x":40,"y":2951,"w":2169,"h":570,"style":{"fill":"#F5F6F7","border":"#6B7C85","font":"#1B3139","bw":1},"notes":"Tables of other domains that this domain references or that reference it (compact view).","level":"neighbor"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.material","x":74,"y":3041,"w":385,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#EBF2F8","border":"#2272B4","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.product_family","x":509,"y":3041,"w":353,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#EBF2F8","border":"#2272B4","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"core.business_partner","x":912,"y":3041,"w":372,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#EBF2F8","border":"#2272B4","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.lot_number_rule","x":1334,"y":3041,"w":347,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#FCF5E8","border":"#E09200","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"core.site","x":1731,"y":3041,"w":366,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#FFEDEB","border":"#FF3621","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"process.step","x":74,"y":3289,"w":398,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#F8ECF5","border":"#B4308B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"process.parameter_def","x":522,"y":3289,"w":328,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#E9F4F4","border":"#0E8388","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.material_plant","x":900,"y":3289,"w":411,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#EBF2F8","border":"#2272B4","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"product.packaging_spec_level","x":1361,"y":3289,"w":385,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#EBF2F8","border":"#2272B4","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"},{"kind":"table","name":"process.step_output","x":1796,"y":3289,"w":379,"h":198,"style":{"fill":"#F8ECF5","border":"#B4308B","font":"#1B3139","bw":2},"mode":"compact"}]}
